      <!-- SECTION III -->
      <h2 class="section-heading">III. Proposed Methodology &amp; System Architecture</h2>

      <h3 class="subsection-heading">A. Four-Tier MERN Architectural Overview</h3>
      <p>
        PRevent is designed as a modular four-tier web application on the MERN stack (MongoDB Atlas, Express.js, React 18, and Node.js) governed by a strict <strong>non-execution safety invariant</strong>: untrusted Pull Request source files and package lifecycle hooks are analyzed purely as structured text and AST/token streams without ever being executed or installed. <strong>Fig. 1</strong> illustrates the complete four-tier system architecture of PRevent.
      </p>

      <!-- FULL WIDTH FIGURE 1 (SVG ARCHITECTURE DIAGRAM) -->
      <div class="full-width-block">
        <div class="figure-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 820 270" width="100%" height="auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;">
            <!-- Background Tiers -->
            <rect x="10" y="10" width="185" height="250" rx="6" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#334155" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="102" y="28" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0f172a">1. React 18 Presentation Tier</text>

            <rect x="215" y="10" width="175" height="250" rx="6" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#334155" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="302" y="28" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0f172a">2. Express Ingestion Tier</text>

            <rect x="410" y="10" width="215" height="250" rx="6" fill="#eef2ff" stroke="#3730a3" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="517" y="28" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1e1b4b">3. Hybrid Security Engine</text>

            <rect x="645" y="10" width="165" height="250" rx="6" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#166534" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="727" y="28" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#064e3b">4. Cloud &amp; Persistence</text>

            <!-- Tier 1 Boxes -->
            <rect x="22" y="42" width="160" height="44" rx="4" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#475569"/>
            <text x="102" y="60" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">Security Overview Dashboard</text>
            <text x="102" y="74" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">&amp; Live GitHub Open PR Browser</text>

            <rect x="22" y="98" width="160" height="44" rx="4" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#475569"/>
            <text x="102" y="116" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">PR Analysis &amp; Interactive</text>
            <text x="102" y="130" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">Issue Resolution Workbench</text>

            <rect x="22" y="154" width="160" height="44" rx="4" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#475569"/>
